	(text "UNRESOLVED: AVDD3 / AVDD1 bypass capacitor values are not given in the ADAR1000 datasheet -> take from ADAR1000-EVALZ schematic."
	(at 210 20 0)
	(effects
		(font
			(size 1.27 1.27)
		)
	)
	(uuid "028798bd-e779-4350-8113-2ce69b0ea407")
)
	(text "PA_BIASx = 0 V at power-up (DS p41): PA drain stays OFF until firmware sets PA_BIAS OFF = -1.75 V (ADTR1107 VGG_PA abs max -2 V)."
	(at 210 25 0)
	(effects
		(font
			(size 1.27 1.27)
		)
	)
	(uuid "9783ca3b-96a8-4c5c-a2cc-ce2307b11577")
)
	(text "SDO errata (DS p47-49): non-addressed SDO not tristated -> read back one chip at a time (separate CSB)."
	(at 210 30 0)
	(effects
		(font
			(size 1.27 1.27)
		)
	)
	(uuid "040a4e3b-4f4f-4a4d-bda4-16ec2800796e")
)
	(text "H2-B GATE-BIAS LIMIT (safety): EXT_PAx_BIAS_OFF/ON and EXT_LNA_BIAS_OFF/ON must stay <= 0x5D (~-1.75 V nominal, V = -code x 4.8/255). NEVER use ADAR1000 Rev B p45 values 0x85 (~-2.5 V) or 0x68 (~-1.96 V): ADTR1107 Rev C abs max VGG_PA -2..0 V, VGG_LNA -2..+0.2 V. Measure PA_BIASx with VDD_PA OFF before enabling the drain."
	(at 210 40 0)
	(effects
		(font
			(size 1.27 1.27)
		)
	)
	(uuid "0b4006c1-0d91-4c74-a47a-9aa189e56031")
)
